                  <nc xml:id="m-be46fcca-577b-4558-9570-87e7d6a07749" pname="g" oct="3" /><nc xml:id="m-992a1229-a21a-4e8d-b714-114faaa502a8" pname="e" oct="3" /><nc xml:id="m-22642ea3-9233-4600-815a-26d615ee80b1" pname="f" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-677f5450-af94-4698-b8c5-15970083a6c8">
                <syl /><neume facs="#m-a0e5a95c-47ba-46f8-9d23-a987392fcb3c" type="clivis" xml:id="m-c7b803c9-bd79-4a32-af2b-c896964140f7">
                  <nc xml:id="m-43523274-24e2-4641-bcf7-dc2d41971ff7" pname="e" oct="3" /><nc xml:id="m-e0b140f9-5ef6-44de-81fa-00af13b36425" pname="d" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><divLine xml:id="m-bff3523d-151c-4583-94e9-6cf2c868b3dd" facs="#m-e1e4f497-cb83-4fc4-a379-23821536cb0f" form="finalis" /></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-adde12b2-4615-4ebd-a56a-ad0d7e019437"><lg xml:id="m-d9028fed-6611-4c64-aead-5bb08b9aa176"><l xml:id="m-3fac7701-442b-4a70-a7c4-c32efbedced0" facs="#m-363d4dd8-d56c-4f23-a75b-66d0e812169c" label="text-like">The Five Absolutions.</l><l xml:id="m-91899259-b081-4e20-b2c6-020672b4707c" facs="#m-2a45369c-6383-42f7-b08f-5785668cedce" label="ambiguous">1823</l><l xml:id="m-85cf88f4-8d62-472c-83e1-71cee72ae43f" facs="#m-8cc9e0f4-d9a9-4606-bde9-a1d8359d2657" label="text-like">on All Souls' day.</l><l xml:id="m-6004d5e0-f8ab-4955-a05b-28862f96f000" facs="#m-092b8349-2e9e-449d-8217-23a4592398fe" label="text-like">Prayer.</l><l xml:id="m-0f3e2915-c7c8-4b6e-8602-8d7fbafce1e8" facs="#m-4b0d3015-7a89-4be2-840b-a6fe255363b9" label="lyrics-like">LIdélium Deus ómnium cónditor semper optavérunt, *piis supplica¬</l><l xml:id="m-d01caf03-3043-4ff8-b7d4-69d77d964023" facs="#m-36b77ac4-31f6-4548-9700-297a31d1ecca" label="lyrics-like">et redémptor, animábus famu¬</l><l xml:id="m-0ea2f220-d323-4e19-9fce-47d777ae3119" facs="#m-08186217-a4b3-4183-bbab-bc6f9ddf2843" label="lyrics-like">tiónibus consequántur. Qui vivis et</l><l xml:id="m-d39e09a5-d11c-4f07-a0f7-f394d01f594b" facs="#m-5f54efa4-a253-49d9-a9bb-031dc318b2ce" label="lyrics-like">regnas in saécula saeculórum.</l><l xml:id="m-0b6b6d58-9d6d-4310-8ec6-795a8a10b4ff" facs="#m-be5d3222-527c-4c81-a130-7d49353d5fd9" label="lyrics-like">lórum famularúmque tuárum remis¬</l><l xml:id="m-fddc1f7b-6b1a-4403-b901-38950cae11af" facs="#m-c82f1a46-bf10-4e91-b3c7-268c8f2df6ca" label="ambiguous">R. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-41ee1ab9-3487-4759-9dbc-6e9b824fe555" facs="#m-fe9acde6-c0eb-43d9-91fb-dbaa16211efd" label="lyrics-like">siónem cunctórum tribue peccató¬</l><l xml:id="m-1d2eacc5-48d0-4638-b06d-6a0a330bc565" facs="#m-e3540807-9b65-4b61-85bc-979ec922967c" label="lyrics-like">rum: t ut indulgéntiam, quam</l><l xml:id="m-dbcdf747-77cb-479a-bc9f-72c290565a8d" facs="#m-125dbfbc-d3d6-4484-8a33-0c54b2d088e6" label="text-like">on the day of All Souls of a Religlous Order.</l><l xml:id="m-508fe395-d684-447b-a5c6-395307c2e05a" facs="#m-f16440a5-7183-4658-b82c-af215d10194e" label="text-like">Prayer.</l><l xml:id="m-9b8b7e38-9162-41cc-b80a-14ddcb992c19" facs="#m-8dc88bc5-8b1d-4fa3-b0e4-3eec87ccb9b1" label="lyrics-like">Eus, véniae largítor et humá¬ semper Virgine intercedénte cum</l><l xml:id="m-3d1ec7ad-79ba-47a0-8a7e-99d38e22bcbc" facs="#m-4830fcfc-04a2-405d-9ec1-3fc0398762e0" label="lyrics-like">I nae salútis amátor: t quaésu-omnibus Sanctis tuis, ad perpétuae</l><l xml:id="m-ac4e77eb-1dfc-42ae-bb00-95b416a22a5f" facs="#m-5dd2ed7e-dcd7-4c41-a987-8a38da532de3" label="lyrics-like">mus cleméntiam tuam; ut nostrae beatitúdinis consórtium pervenire</l><l xml:id="m-2a8bd36d-4dfd-4efc-9759-2ca79d75590b" facs="#m-0df335a4-e6eb-4925-9606-ab3e38464322" label="lyrics-like">congregatiónis fratres qui ex hoc concédas. Per Christum Dóminum</l><l xml:id="m-ea9969e1-40b4-42a9-9a52-eda3004edf97" facs="#m-aa31f77c-993d-426f-b97b-d93595a82bb3" label="lyrics-like">saéculo transiérunt, * béáta María ] nostrum.</l><l xml:id="m-5ee3f194-9231-4a1e-a12a-1ffb1b216e50" facs="#m-201fc347-f13f-4fbb-9f94-c83eaade3886" label="ambiguous">C </l><l xml:id="m-fafb61c1-4517-41ff-9d56-3ff68314e191" facs="#m-e716046f-ca58-4f6d-a22c-87c5b6042e43" label="text-like">THE FIVE ABSOLUTIONS</l><l xml:id="m-33908535-16a8-4b3c-8e89-ce35aa808a11" facs="#m-e899a9dd-929a-4961-8310-a7bc181f646f" label="text-like">OF SOLEMN FUNERAL SERVICES.</l><l xml:id="m-3b30eb6c-8ab5-4458-aa99-b462360a8daf" facs="#m-af7df888-4ceb-485d-a66c-9c57eed4ab7a" label="text-like">After the officiating Bishop has said the Prayer Non intres. the Cantor¬</l><l xml:id="m-4eeca316-7ac4-4e0b-bc02-28ae15fe1dfe" facs="#m-b01ede88-ffd0-453e-bedc-67c4c6d87bc9" label="ambiguous">intone:</l><l xml:id="m-6316f495-aea6-4605-94a0-69959a8d0a11" facs="#m-93428a93-916f-42fc-b78e-c5ae306d5be2" label="lyrics-like">The First Responsory : Subvenite. D. 1765. Then Kyrie eléison.</l><l xml:id="m-edf933c5-101b-4695-b103-ed6ea7298f1e" facs="#m-50d4b8f8-f345-4af5-b7c7-88b51e74db0a" label="lyrics-like">is sung and Páter nóster. etc., as on p. 1768.</l><l xml:id="m-7310c6c6-d193-4fd6-b0f5-cfec9d10ffff" facs="#m-714afb35-96c0-43f5-a14c-de2930f04bc1" label="lyrics-like">Orémus.</l><l xml:id="m-9e272504-37e4-4d11-a0c7-ba8bed1e4c56" facs="#m-d0be8c71-0024-40cb-8a28-bb789af2a4d1" label="lyrics-like">Eus, cui ómnia vivunt, et cui tui Abrahae patriárchae, resusci¬</l><l xml:id="m-8a16b3c3-e9d0-4ed1-876b-f51a509c2c44" facs="#m-8ff94f48-997e-4df2-b93f-f0bb00c333b0" label="lyrics-like">non péreunt moriéndo córpora</l><l xml:id="m-a7a698c3-78fc-4448-a8db-55032a4ac362" facs="#m-81c0daed-ee7a-4257-94d1-42886f7436eb" label="lyrics-like">tandámque in novíssimo judicii ma¬</l><l xml:id="m-0de9c49f-6da6-4631-ade5-b0bbb5edc436" facs="#m-3edfc25b-30e9-407c-b476-852422c4ecfb" label="lyrics-like">nostra, sed mutántur in mélius:</l><l xml:id="m-509812e0-96c4-40a1-bd47-53b7dda96b78" facs="#m-4ff19bee-53ef-4960-a6ad-8ee00e3c4d0b" label="lyrics-like">gni die,*et quidquid vitiórum, diá¬</l><l xml:id="m-52e9cdad-c747-44f7-95dc-477648b09d54" facs="#m-1b306273-d24c-4f52-a622-2f2a35ef8283" label="lyrics-like">bolo fallénte, contráxit, tu pius et</l><l xml:id="m-15c00bb6-ca13-4142-9eb3-53f70c1bacc8" facs="#m-b4353895-89cc-4f8d-baca-e0c25c631575" label="lyrics-like">te súpplices deprecámur: ut súscipi</l><l xml:id="m-212be8a7-56ea-43af-9f5b-34de1516aab4" facs="#m-9fac21a3-93ff-4d14-a976-844c8c89acc3" label="lyrics-like">júbeas ánimam fámuli tui N. per</l><l xml:id="m-c2b55c2d-d91e-446b-86b4-479d562c26e4" facs="#m-0eaca6c5-3d91-4fa2-a92c-5f2ddec418fa" label="lyrics-like">miséricors ábluas indulgéndo. Per</l><l xml:id="m-f9941a9a-4f18-4b64-961f-fb01c54c681b" facs="#m-0cf02e49-1e4b-47b5-b745-e4dc8bef9057" label="lyrics-like">manus sanctórum Angelórum tuó-] Christum Dóminum nostrum.</l><l xml:id="m-2cd155c1-fa9f-4911-a0ef-ae3095fa2df2" facs="#m-e2e19263-a3af-49ba-8fc0-89cb266483e3" label="lyrics-like">rum deducéndam in sinum amíci!</l><l xml:id="m-a260aee4-95ae-4a76-a978-4c14d14549d6" facs="#m-255909f3-b971-47b7-9eba-ee3f8f7cfbf9" label="ambiguous">R. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-f29e6e8d-7764-4e76-be62-dd2f97965e66" facs="#m-d3413041-9c1f-4327-bddf-b0012723cfa3" label="lyrics-like">The Second Responsory: Qui Lázarum. D. 1786, to which the</l><l xml:id="m-ec4b27a7-85fb-4e3e-a097-0af9a7101ce6" facs="#m-2e4b03b7-dc33-4f8a-9219-c2e86f73d0c1" label="text-like">following Versicle is daded:</l><l xml:id="m-b44eddf8-4f50-4029-98e4-0c5ff62ad6bd" facs="#m-27f8bde4-e65e-4e03-8b87-24ad6170aa6c" label="lyrics-like">V. Réqui-em</l><l xml:id="m-9a4f7c0d-a87b-4b15-b90f-110ea49b9a42" facs="#m-8864600e-3fdf-4793-97e3-aa2fa4d99c86" label="lyrics-like">aetérnam dóna é-is Dómi- ne:</l><l xml:id="m-be239ec5-9d85-443e-aac9-19f89293080d" facs="#m-98a09247-5f2e-4454-ac07-0142f473e681" label="lyrics-like">é¬</l><l xml:id="m-75141aa9-16a3-453c-8cd4-25f86aca11fc" facs="#m-43a1a987-b62c-4764-a652-67d4c7a06dc7" label="lyrics-like">et lux perpé-tu-a lú¬ ce-at</l><l xml:id="m-a6d91700-3b23-47d6-87ff-ad16ffc59798" facs="#m-69d30e89-e8b5-4b32-ab3d-78b2c1ef9bee" label="text-like">is.</l><l xml:id="m-7084ed40-8033-4a44-b733-1004a15511c5" facs="#m-e4e9afff-3aa1-4c00-81e8-ec5616762548" label="lyrics-like">Kyrie eléison. etc., p. 1768.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
